<title>HONG KONG: Peace Bank of Korea sets US$40 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Peace Bank of Korea sets US$40 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by arranger WestLB Asia Pacific.</p>
<p> BORROWER PEACE BANK OF KOREA</p>
<p> AMOUNT   US$40 MLN     COUPON    3ML+60 BP  MATURITY  3 YRS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	    ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCH    06.JUN.97</p>
<p> PUTS     YR 2	    CALLS     YR 2	 REPLIES   23.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING  --		REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS    US$250K</p>
<p> RATING   --		SALE LMTS STANDARD   TAX PROV  --</p>
<p> HOME CTRY S.KOREA	GOV LAW   ENGLISH    PAY DATE  10.JUL.97</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>	     CO-LEAD MANAGERS US$4-5 MLN  36 BP  ALL-IN 78 BP</p>
<p>	     SENIOR  MANAGERS US$2-3 MLN  32 BP  ALL-IN 76 BP</p>
<p>ARRANGERS GOLDMAN SACHS ASIA, KDB ASIA, KEXIM ASIA, AND WESTLB</p>
<p>	     ASIA PACIFIC</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039  http://www.hk97.com</p>
